the succ of 24 is 25.

the succ of 25 is 26.

the succ of 26 is 27.

the succ of 27 is 28.

the succ of 28 is 29.

the succ of 29 is 30.

the succ of 30 is 31.

the succ of 31 is 32.

the succ of 31 is 33.

the add one row of 1 is 2.

the add one row of 2 is 3.

the add one row of 3 is 4.

the add one row of 4 is 5.

the add two row of 1 is 3.

the add two row of 2 is 4.

the add two row of 3 is 5.

the add one col of 1 is 2.

the add one col of 2 is 3.

the add two col of 1 is 3.

the scoremap of 0 is 0.

the scoremap of 1 is 1.

the scoremap of 2 is 3.

the scoremap of 3 is 7.

the scoremap of 4 is 11.

the scoremap of 5 is 16.

the scoremap of 6 is 22.

the scoremap of 7 is 29.

the scoremap of 8 is 37.

the scoremap of 9 is 45.

the scoremap of 10 is 54.

the scoremap of 11 is 64.

the scoremap of 12 is 75.

the scoremap of 13 is 87.

the scoremap of 14 is 100.

the move move with a role, a row, a col, a thing and a second thing is legal at a time if
    the role is a control at the time
    and it is not the case that the role is played at the time
    and the role cell the row with the col with knight at the time
    and the row knightmove the col with the thing with the second thing.

the goal of a role is a number at a time if
    the role captures a count at the time
    and the scoremap of the count is the number.

the game is terminal at a time if
    33 is a step at the time.

when the move move with a role, a row, a col, a thing and a second thing is made
then the role cell the thing with the second thing with knight
    and the role cell the row with the col with blank
    and it is not the case that the role cell the thing with the second thing with blank
    and it is not the case that the role cell the thing with the second thing with pawn
    and it is not the case that the role cell the row with the col with knight.

when the move move with a role, a row, a col, a thing and a second thing is made
    and the role cell the thing with the second thing with pawn
    and the role captures a count
    and the succ of the count is a third thing
then the role captures the third thing
    and it is not the case that the role captures the count.

when the move move with a role, a row, a col, a thing and a second thing is made
then the role is played.

when the move tick is made
then it is not the case that left is played
    and it is not the case that right is played.

when the move tick is made
    and a thing is a step
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the thing is a step.

when the move tick is made
    and left is a control
then right is a control
    and it is not the case that left is a control.

when the move tick is made
    and right is a control
then left is a control
    and it is not the case that right is a control.

it must not be true that
    the move move with a role, a row, a col, a thing and a second thing is made
    and it is not the case that the move move with the role, the row, the col, the thing and the second thing is legal.

initially left cell 1 with 1 with knight
    and left cell 1 with 2 with pawn
    and left cell 1 with 3 with pawn
    and left cell 2 with 1 with pawn
    and left cell 2 with 2 with pawn
    and left cell 2 with 3 with pawn
    and left cell 3 with 1 with pawn
    and left cell 3 with 2 with pawn
    and left cell 3 with 3 with pawn
    and left cell 4 with 1 with pawn
    and left cell 4 with 2 with pawn
    and left cell 4 with 3 with pawn
    and left cell 5 with 1 with pawn
    and left cell 5 with 2 with pawn
    and left cell 5 with 3 with pawn
    and right cell 1 with 1 with knight
    and right cell 1 with 2 with pawn
    and right cell 1 with 3 with pawn
    and right cell 2 with 1 with pawn
    and right cell 2 with 2 with pawn
    and right cell 2 with 3 with pawn
    and right cell 3 with 1 with pawn
    and right cell 3 with 2 with pawn
    and right cell 3 with 3 with pawn
    and right cell 4 with 1 with pawn
    and right cell 4 with 2 with pawn
    and right cell 4 with 3 with pawn
    and right cell 5 with 1 with pawn
    and right cell 5 with 2 with pawn
    and right cell 5 with 3 with pawn
    and left captures 0
    and right captures 0
    and 1 is a step
    and left is a control.

