    the move move with left, 1, 1, 2 and 3 is made from 1 to 2.
    the move tick is made from 2 to 3.
    the move tick is made from 3 to 4.
    the move move with left, 2, 3, 3 and 1 is made from 4 to 5.
    the move tick is made from 5 to 6.
    the move tick is made from 6 to 7.
    the move move with left, 3, 1, 4 and 3 is made from 7 to 8.
